QNX has no linux/net_tstamp.h, asm/socket.h, endian.h, linux/reboot.h, bits/getopt_core.h, EPOLLONESHOT or HOST_NAME_MAX, and its getopt() does not permute: take the receive time from SO_TIMESTAMP (qnx-socketcan), define the byte order, re-arm the command listener by hand, hand a reboot to shutdown, and accept the device name before the options.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

